# ⚠️ `script/build-*.ts` matches `script/build-node.ts`, which is a REQUIRED, tracked build script
# (it builds the Electron sidecar). The pattern is inert here because the file is already tracked —
# but the v0.1.0 publish created a FRESH repo from the working tree, where it was untracked, so this
# rule silently dropped it. The published source on GitHub and the novaclaw.app source zip therefore
# cannot build the sidecar at all. Keep the negation.
script/build-*.ts
!script/build-node.ts
